# ============================================================================
#  ab_simulator2.ancl  -  ANCL Native EtherNet/IP CIP PLC Simulator 2
#
#  A native Win32 dark-themed EtherNet/IP CIP PLC simulator, written in ANCL.
#  NexusEdge themed with GlowButtons, virtual point database in ListView,
#  accepts connections on port 44818 and responds to EIP/CIP service requests.
#
#  100% CRT-free PE32+, GUI subsystem.
# ============================================================================

